Z||000007||rogergarrison||09-01-2001||08:03 AM||||I wouldnt want it on column unless it was an automatic. My uncle had a 5 speed on column in a Simca, it was wierd.<P>for cupholders I just solved my problem. I took off the molded plastic lower door panels on a 91-93 Pontiac Bonneville. they have a few storage spaces, and a cup holder, and even a small grill for mounting a speaker. just took a little trimming and looks nice, just screws onto the door panel.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P1000556.jpg"> ||||reg||1
